  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "規个城市lóng leh眠夢"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>謝昀臻</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規个城市lóng leh眠夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拍m̄見ê聲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">消失tī罩bông hit粒山</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">彩色ê光&nbsp; &nbsp; 閃爍ê青春</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē輸桌頂食--過ê hit包薰</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">是行--過ê jiâu痕</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢ê鐵枝路是夢想ê寄託</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿妹仔褪赤跤&nbsp; &nbsp; 行tī lo̍k糊糜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">跤盤mauh做血肉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">為著討食</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顛倒落làm</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsiânn做空思夢想一齣電影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">規个城市lóng leh眠夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">拍m̄見ê心bih踮烏雲ê kha-tsiah-phiann</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán-si ê靈魂</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">甕肚ê人&nbsp; &nbsp; 計較社會輸贏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Suah等無幸福hit幫車&nbsp; &nbsp; 凡勢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雨停hit一工</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē kā規个城市沃tâm</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrldw8BuR87slPkQdfZoyGM9ehTQNQ7DhT5TWcTX2qc1X8mSbYvcg6ta1RgFQXqL9fcpHSt9ugTxZUKAo4nZPVMyDU2-WDMR_lBk1WlrZ96SjSlgVYC0_RltR6sD0DChXqgc2yjohFnjspg_H6_A3Tdbrl5Ry066HfZkDbB4l91b-SlLTb-dPctseBhg/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjrldw8BuR87slPkQdfZoyGM9ehTQNQ7DhT5TWcTX2qc1X8mSbYvcg6ta1RgFQXqL9fcpHSt9ugTxZUKAo4nZPVMyDU2-WDMR_lBk1WlrZ96SjSlgVYC0_RltR6sD0DChXqgc2yjohFnjspg_H6_A3Tdbrl5Ry066HfZkDbB4l91b-SlLTb-dPctseBhg/w450-h640/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjoA3P1g1S4q0sswpKrEwqYeMeSy3yNuYJYycCUlmxi08VGwvyiwMEEgED-vkWTE_w1IEbOFoySYpjKUvOsnYUsfRaeWjHsGTbltllHPBxNSyv6lICqltmfKOOq5i3U926kZ2vsRQbC-MllxmtIFcw78FZ7F1vloYIlpj_9srkahjI2VU_i3vOf-151Yg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_01.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" 